      "title": "Upcoming Events",
      "description": "Center for Career and Professional Development | Clemson University Skip to content Skip to AI Search Skip to main nav Search Keywords Log in Sign up Guests Clemson Home ClemsonJobLink Make an Appointment Request a Workshop Contact Us How do I… Develop Resumes, CVs & Cover Letters Search for a Job or Internship Explore Majors & Careers Prepare for an Interview Prepare for Graduate School Expand My Network Research Salaries & Negotiate Offers Enroll in the Cooperative Education Program Grow in Core Competencies Reserve an Interview Room Visit the Career Closet Visit the Career Innovation Lab View Recorded Workshops Students Undergraduate Students Graduate Students First Year Alumni Alumni Career Paths Accounting & Finance Agriculture, Food & Natural Resources Architecture & Construction Arts, Audio/Video Technology & Communications Business Management & Administration Education & Training Engineering & Technology Government & Public Administration Health Science Hospitality & Tourism Human Services Information Technology Law & Policy Marketing Operations & Logistics Science & Mathematics CCPD Programs Career Services Cooperative Education Program (Co-op) On-Campus Internships (UPIC) Off-Campus Internships International Internship Program Internship Prep Program | Tigers on Track Partners Employers Corporate Partners Faculty & Staff Parents & Families About Us Mission & Vision Meet the Team Outcomes & Data Visit the CCPD Frequently Asked Questions Clemson University Home Drop-Ins begin August 24th in the Learning Commons @ Cooper Library Mornings 10:00 AM - 11:30 AM (Resumes) | Afternoons 1:30 PM - 3:30 PM Upcoming Events September Sep 08 Event: Networking with Confidence Workshop Tue, Sep 8 from 10am - 10:30am Tuesday, September 8th from 10am - 10:30am Sep 08 Event: Virtual Workshop: How to Work a Career Fair if You're Introverted Tue, Sep 8 from 11:30am - 12pm Tuesday, September 8th from 11:30am - 12pm Sep 08 Event: LandDesign (2026-09-08 14:00:00) Tue, Sep 8 from 2pm - 2:30pm Tuesday, September 8th from 2pm - 2:30pm Sep 09 Event: Ask Me Anything About the Career Fair Tabling Series Wed, Sep 9 from 9am - 4pm Wednesday, September 9th from 9am - 4pm Sep 10 Event: Meeting Street Schools (2026-09-10 08:30:00) Thu, Sep 10 from 8:30am - 3:30pm Thursday, September 10th from 8:30am - 3:30pm Sep 10 Event: Virtual Workshop: Crafting Your Elevator Pitch Workshop Thu, Sep 10 from 9am - 9:30am Thursday, September 10th from 9am - 9:30am Sep 10 Event: Transfer Students: Get Career Fair Ready! Thu, Sep 10 from 11am - 1pm Thursday, September 10th from 11am - 1pm Sep 11 Event: Coffee and Critiques Fri, Sep 11 from 9am - 11am Friday, September 11th from 9am - 11am Sep 14 Event: How to Follow Up with Employers After the Fair Workshop Mon, Sep 14 from 3:30pm - 4pm Monday, September 14th from 3:30pm - 4pm Sep 14 Event: Actuarial Science and Financial Math Fall Expo 2026 Mon, Sep 14 from 5:30pm - 7:30pm Monday, September 14th from 5:30pm - 7:30pm See more events Our Corporate Partners Toggle animation View All Career Services Discover resources tailored to support you at every step of your career journey. Schedule a career counseling appointment today and let us assist you in achieving your goals. Learn More Co-op Program Experience the Cooperative Education Program (Co-op Program) and develop professional skills before graduation. Learn More Employers Connect with students, identify potential candidates, and increase your company’s visibility through Clemson’s Career Center. Learn More UPIC Internships Explore Clemson’s UPIC on-campus internship program, designed to enhance student engagement by offering opportunities to work closely with faculty or administration. Learn More Off-Campus Internships Explore off-campus internships that provide valuable work experience and connections with professionals before graduation. Learn More International Internships Explore international internships, where students earn academic credit while interning full-time for eight weeks internationally. Learn More Sidebar Follow Here For More Career Content! Job & Internship Opportunities Electrical Engineer Intern - APG (East Region) Job Details | Black & Veatch Family of Companies Black & Veatch Civil Engineering Intern - Land Development, Summer 2027 Bohler Engineering Commissioning Engineer Intern Merrick & Company Software Engineering - Intern, Graduate Intel Associate Development Program March 2027 (San Francisco) First Citizens Bank Entry Level Civil Engineer - Land Development Bohler Engineering 2027 Software Engineer Intern - Linthicum Maryland Northrop Grumman GENERAL STUDENT TRAINEE (INDUSTRIAL SECURITY) Defense Counterintelligence and Security Agency: Department of Defense 2027 Electrical Engineering Internship - Dulles VA Northrop Grumman 2027 Intern - Product Support Engineer Northrop Grumman See All Jobs Contact & Location Phone (864) 656-6000 Email careercenter@clemson.edu Website https://career.clemson.edu Address 2nd Floor, Nieri Family Alumni and Visitors Center 220 Madren Center Drive Clemson, SC 29634-4007 Career Service Hours M Monday 8:00 am - 4:30 pm T Tuesday 8:00 am - 4:30 pm W Wednesday 8:00 am - 4:30 pm TH Thursday 8:00 am - 4:30 pm F Friday 8:00 am - 4:30 pm Meet the Team Dr. Neil Burton Meet Neil Julie Biggers, MEd Meet Julie Andrea Haitz Meet Andrea Lynne Marcus Meet Lynne Dr. Jeff Neal Meet Dr. Jeff Dr. Troy Nunamaker Meet Troy Dave Sargent, MBA Meet Dave Maggie Erickson Meet Maggie Phone (864) 656-6000 Email careercenter@clemson.edu Website https://career.clemson.edu Address 2nd Floor, Nieri Family Alumni and Visitors Center 220 Madren Center Drive Clemson, SC 29634-4007 Instagram LinkedIn YouTube Footer Column 2 Jobs & Internships Resources Meet the Team Events Privacy Policy | Terms of Service Copyright © 2026 Clemson University"
