rustees University Committees show submenu for University Committees University Committees Overview Committees Boards Councils Faculty Recognition show submenu for Faculty Recognition Faculty Recognition Overview Endowed Chairs and Titled Professors Centennial Professorship Alan Schaffer Award Class of ’39 Award Dispute Resolution show submenu for Dispute Resolution Dispute Resolution Overview Grievance Clemson Home Faculty and Staff Current: Faculty Senate The Clemson University Faculty Senate is a long-standing organization that gives faculty a collective voice in shaping the academic experience at Clemson. Established under Article II of the Constitution of the Faculty of Clemson University, the Faculty Senate serves as the official representative body for faculty and works closely with university leadership to recommend new policies and improvements to existing ones. Through this work, the Senate helps influence decisions that affect teaching, learning, and campus life. For more than fifty years, the Faculty Senate has supported initiatives that strengthen the university community, promote shared governance, and enhance the overall experience for both faculty and students at Clemson University. Clemson University Faculty Manual has been published, August 1, 2026 Faculty Manual Consultant Memorandum General Faculty Meeting - Minutes September 8th Faculty Senate Meeting - Agenda Minutes Faculty Senate Standing Agenda 2026-2027 (PDF) Join Virtual Meeting Faculty Senate Events Clemson University Facebook Instagram Twitter/X Linkedin Youtube Policy Accessibility Title IX Non-Discrimination & Anti-Harassment Policy Ethics/Safety\n    \t\t\t\t\t\t\tHotline Privacy Statement Copyright © 2026 Clemson University • Clemson, South Carolina 29634 Clemson University Clemson University Facebook Clemson University Instagram Clemson University Twitter/X Clemson University Linkedin Clemson University Youtube Resources A-Z Index Campus Map CU Safety Directory Webcams Apply to\n   