niversity. The Office of Human Resources offers both in-person and online sessions, both of which satisfy the University’s orientation requirements. New employees do not need to complete both modules. The in-person orientation session includes lunch in a campus dining hall and a bus and walking tour of campus. Participants should dress appropriately and wear comfortable shoes. Individuals must attend the entirety of the full-day session to receive credit for completion. If you need to request accommodations or have questions, email tigertraining@clemson.edu . Register for In-Person Orientation Register for Online Orientation Campus Map Contact Us Office of Human Resources Copyright © Clemson University Office of Human Resources | 108 Perimeter Rd, Clemson, SC 29634 Contact Us intro-arrow Engage With Us Through Instagram - Office of Human Resources Twitter - Office of Human Resources LinkedIn - Office of Human Resources Clemson University Facebook Instagram Twitter/X Linkedin Youtube Policy Accessibility Title IX Non-Discrimination & Anti-Harassment Policy Ethics/Safety\n    \t\t\t\t\t\t\tHotline Privacy Statement Copyright © 2026 Clemson University • Clemson, South Carolina 29634 Clemson University Clemson University Facebook Clemson University Instagram Clemson University Twitter/X Clemson University Linkedin Clemson University Youtube Resources A-Z Index Campus Map CU Safety Directory Webcams Apply to\n    \t\t\t\t\t\t\tClemson"
