    "https://twitter.com/ClemsonCareers": {
      "title": "Clemson Careers",
      "description": "Clemson Careers (@ClemsonCareers) / X Log in Sign up Clemson Careers 5,955 posts Clemson Careers @ClemsonCareers Official page for the latest updates on Clemson job postings. Clemson, South Carolina linktr.ee/clemsoncareers Joined July 2012 1,172 Following 2,622 Followers Mention Follow Posts Posts Replies Replies Reposts Reposts Media Media Log in or sign up for X See what’s happening and join the conversation Continue with phone Continue with Apple Continue with Google or Log in with username or email Terms · Privacy · Cookies · Accessibility · US TIDA · Ads Info · More © 2026 X Corp. Clemson Careers @ClemsonCareers Sep 1 Apply today for Open Rank Tenure or Clinical Faculty - Large Animal & Ambulatory Services, Harvey S. Peeler Jr. College of Veterinary Medicine!\n\nThis role will focus on clinical service, teaching, and research.\n\nApply Here! apply.interfolio.com/189870 422 Clemson Careers @ClemsonCareers May 19 Apply today for Systems Specialist - Harvey S. Peeler Jr. College of Veterinary Medicine!\n\nThis role supports the administration, configuration, and operation of CVM application systems, including EMR, PACS, and Slate.\n\nApply Here! tinyurl.com/mr3d9tex 🐅 54 Clemson Careers @ClemsonCareers May 1 Apply today for Ambulatory LVT with the Harvey S. Peeler Jr. College of Veterinary Medicine!\n\nThis role performs licensed vet tech duties & provides operational support to a team of veterinary professionals in Ambulatory Services.\n\nApply Here! tinyurl.com/3sf6bwkb 🐅 73 Clemson Careers @ClemsonCareers May 1 Apply today for Post Award Accountant with the College of Science!\n\nThis role manages all aspects of sponsored projects in assigned units during an award's life cycle.\n\nApply Here! tinyurl.com/mv2anyf4 🐅 62 Clemson Careers @ClemsonCareers Apr 29 Apply today for Registered Nurse I - Redfern Student Health Center!\n\nThis role provides direct nursing assessment, care, and patient education in a clinic setting.\n\nApply Here! tinyurl.com/23krdsw7 🐅 72"
    }
